\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Overview of the Camerala System Architecture. The system runs entirely client-side, processing webcam frames via MediaPipe Face Mesh (Wasm) to extract rPPG and Head Motion signals in real-time. Data is synchronized with the Psychophysics Task Engine (Canvas API) and stored locally, ensuring no raw video ever leaves the user's device.}}{5}{}\protected@file@percent }
